              "subject": "A minimal top-down arrangement of mezze plates \u2014 hummus, olives, flatbread, and small bowls \u2014 laid out on a shared table surface.",
              "purpose": "Creates immediate visual appetite appeal and communicates the communal mezze concept without requiring photography.",
              "quantity": 1,
              "used_by": [
                "home-section-1"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "home-section-2",
          "type": "feature_grid",
          "intent": "Highlight the three core pillars of the Levante experience so visitors immediately understand what makes this restaurant distinct.",
          "eyebrow": "Why Levante",
          "headline": "A Different Kind of Dinner",
          "subheadline": "Three principles guide everything we put on the table.",
          "body": null,
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "Seasonal & Sourced",
              "description": "Our mezze changes with the season. We work with regional suppliers to bring the freshest ingredients from farm and sea to your table.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "title": "Built for Sharing",
              "description": "Every plate is designed to be passed, tasted, and discussed. The more people at the table, the better the meal.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "title": "Rooted in Tradition",
              "description": "Our recipes draw from Lebanese, Turkish, Greek, and Israeli culinary traditions \u2014 interpreted with care and precision.",
              "metadata": {}
            }
          ],
          "ctas": [],
          "asset_ideas": []
        },
        {
