          "headline": "Born from a Table in Beirut",
          "subheadline": "Levante began as a memory \u2014 a long afternoon, a crowded table, and fifteen plates that never seemed to run out.",
          "body": "Our founders carried that experience back across the Mediterranean and spent two years perfecting the menu you'll find here today. Levante isn't just a restaurant. It's a format for gathering.",
