          "eyebrow": "The Beginning",
          "headline": "An Afternoon That Refused to End",
          "subheadline": null,
          "body": "In 2019, co-founders Nadia Khalil and Marco Esposito sat down for what was supposed to be a quick lunch at a family-run mezze house in Beirut's Gemmayzeh neighborhood. Four hours later, they were still at the table. The food had long since been cleared, but the conversation \u2014 and the feeling \u2014 refused to leave. They came home with notebooks full of recipes, supplier contacts, and a single shared conviction: that the mezze format, done right, could change how people eat together in any city in the world. Levante opened its first location in 2021.",
